      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجَدَ بِالمَكَانِ</span></b> , (S, A, L, K, *) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجُدَ</span></b> , (L,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُجُودٌ</span> (S, L, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبْجِيدٌ</span>; (Kr;) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بجّد</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبْجِيدٌ</span>; (L, K;) <i>He remained,
stayed, abode,</i> or <i>dwelt,</i> (S, A, L, K,) <i>in the
place;</i> (S, A, L;) <i>settled,</i> or <i>remained fixed, in
it; not quitting it.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجَدَتِ الإِبَلُ</span>, (L,
